#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:175
#: 9a214a66001f4a59a738e188e09d62a9
msgid "Magnetic interference and Board Voltage check"
msgstr "磁干扰与板载电压检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:177
#: 0547033390cf47e1bfc30d650cff26c5
msgid ""
"The EPM can cause magnetic interference especially while gripping or "
"releasing the cargo or if left in the \"on\" state with no cargo attached.  "
"Make sure to mount the EPM at least 10cm from the flight controller's "
"compass."
msgstr ""
"EPM 可能产生磁干扰，尤其是在抓取或释放货物时，或在未附载货物的情况下保持「开启」状态时。请确保 EPM 安装位置距飞控罗盘至少 10cm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:182
#: 77ec8a65cf7c43bc8f3d7e23c077ca23
msgid ""
"The EPM's impact on the compass can be tested in real-time by connecting "
"with the Mission Planner, go to the Flight Data screen and click on the "
"\"Tuning\" checkbox at the bottom, middle.  Double click on the graph that "
"appears on the top right and when the \"Graph This\" window appears select "
"\"magfield\"."
msgstr ""
"EPM 对罗盘的影响可通过连接 Mission Planner "
"进行实时测试，进入飞行数据页面，点击底部中间的「Tuning」复选框。双击右上角出现的图表，在弹出的「Graph "
"This」窗口中选择「magfield」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:188
#: a9c4802b4c1a487dbe3d3e946daae25a
msgid ""
"Turning the EPM on and off and ensure the magfield length does not change by"
" more than 10%."
msgstr "开关 EPM 并确保磁场强度变化不超过 10%。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-gripper.rst:194
#: e83401d22e3d4cba8678ecf67c9264e7
msgid ""
"In addition to magnetic interference, if a weak BEC is used a voltage drop "
"may be noticed.  For example the BEC in a 3DR ESC leads to a drop of 0.4V "
"when the EPM is activated.  This is normally not a concern because the BEC "
"should only be powering the servo rail of the autopilot, so the CPU's "
"voltage should be unaffected.  This can be tested by graphing the "
"\"hwvoltage\" field in the same way the \"magfield\" was checked above.  "
"Ideally this test should be performed when connected via :ref:`Telemetry "
"<common-telemetry-landingpage>`\\ because a USB cable will also provide "
"power the CPU and may hide any voltage disturbance."
msgstr ""
"除磁干扰外，如果使用的 BEC 功率不足，可能会出现电压下降。例如，3DR 电调内置 BEC 在 EPM 激活时会导致约 0.4V "
"的电压降。这通常不是问题，因为 BEC 应只为飞控的舵机总线供电，CPU "
"电压应不受影响。可以通过以与上述「magfield」相同的方式绘制「hwvoltage」字段来进行测试。理想情况下，该测试应在通过 :ref:`数传 "
"<common-telemetry-landingpage>` 连接时进行，因为 USB 线缆也会为 CPU 供电，可能会掩盖电压扰动。"

